  "description": "EHIMER crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H42 Eu4 F24 N6 O16,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.556-3.889 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.42-110.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H42Eu4F24N6O16.",
